  "description": "Dimensionless three-stage negative feedback, not a calibrated circadian clock. Reconstructs a retired flowless concept with complete dynamics. Initial state [0.0054,0.053,1.93], coefficients [2,4,0.12,0.08,0.1], Hill exponent10 and 0-100 horizon follow PINTS documented mathematical benchmark; our RK4 output step0.05 is a verification choice. https://pints.readthedocs.io/en/stable/toy/goodwin_oscillator_model.html Signed net-rate flows encode equations, not material transfer claims. No clamps or hidden state resets.",
  "source": "https://doi.org/10.1016/0065-2571(65)90067-1",
  "reference": "Goodwin (1965), Oscillatory behavior in enzymatic control processes; Griffith (1968), doi:10.1016/0022-5193(68)90189-6. Numerical benchmark: PINTS GoodwinOscillatorModel.",
